{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1787548201990511001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"heavyset-dowdy-barb","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"7e5a185daf77e2d18fa2a7f94c07cd30e405222ece9275792bb0dbd812166544","event_uuid":"3f232d70-4ab0-48c6-9dfa-4c31137fb85f","position":{"commit_sha":"3573e8549654cc280615f2120fbd8d2466e390a1","position":"1787544613312234001-3f232d70-4ab0-48c6-9dfa-4c31137fb85f"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"3f2067a76e391ecc8bc4bea0e9a267c4e69d37c7c675ea185c299958331690c9","event_uuid":"fb6d0122-5ff0-43b3-ae3f-28965674eae9","position":{"commit_sha":"76e6b91fcc737e8329a71504d591ab0976859aa1","position":"1787544658922215001-fb6d0122-5ff0-43b3-ae3f-28965674eae9"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1787544613312234001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"fb6d0122-5ff0-43b3-ae3f-28965674eae9","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"0754-cfc5-e451-4e9b"}],"description":"## Context\n\nGerrit change 2169 passed LLM review and CI, but the reviewer recorded four non-blocking hardening opportunities for the new explicit tracker-footprint command.\n\nThe primary correctness question is an alternates-backed shared clone: the mounted pack layer currently measures only the primary common object database and can report near-zero while objects reside in alternates. The report labels the object database shared and the definition says primary, so this is not a blocker for the fresh-clone incident measurement, but the mounted interpretation should be made harder to misuse.\n\nThe other findings are portable test gaps: allocation-ratio assertions depend on filesystem block charging, and the unavailable-allocation text plus bad-argument exit-2 paths lack direct coverage.\n\n## Plan\n\n- Decide and document whether mounted pack reporting should enumerate alternate object databases or retain primary-only scope with an explicit unavailable/non-exclusive interpretation.\n- Add a real shared-clone fixture that pins the chosen semantics without double-counting shared objects.\n- Replace filesystem-ratio assumptions with deterministic injected/stat capability assertions.\n- Cover text rendering when allocation is unavailable and CLI parse failure exit code 2.\n- Preserve the command as opt-in, read-only, unscheduled, non-gating, and threshold-free.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] Alternates-backed mounted reporting cannot be mistaken for an exclusive whole-object-store pack measurement.\n- [ ] Shared-clone coverage proves the chosen ownership and deduplication semantics.\n- [ ] Allocation-unavailable text and bad-argument exit 2 have direct tests.\n- [ ] Tests do not depend on a particular filesystem block allocation policy.\n- [ ] make lint, make typecheck, and focused tests pass.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["footprint","git","tests"],"ticket_id":"ed53-bc12-ab39-4845","ticket_type":"task","title":"Harden tracker-footprint shared-clone semantics and edge-path coverage","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["3f232d70-4ab0-48c6-9dfa-4c31137fb85f","fb6d0122-5ff0-43b3-ae3f-28965674eae9"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787548201990511001,"uuid":"b72dd47c-8329-4cd4-8b49-78974459210c"}